> > 2 "some/all of the four bears"
> > 3 "four of the bears"
> > 4 "some/all of bears" ("some/all of [all of a set-of-bears]")
> > 5 "all of the bears"
> > 6 "four of bears" ("four of [all of a set-of-bears]")
> > 7 "all of the four bears"
